      "value": "phys bones do not affect file size more than like 1 kilobyte. you have 10 megabytes. considering you shouldnt be using textures larger than 4096x4096 and thats if you need a lot of detail. and theres no avatar audio. you can fit an avatar with like 8 full outfits on it on quest within the 10MB limit.",
