  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "I feel as someone who like to make avatars quest compatable it would be easier to make it quest compatable if the limit were raised. I feel doubling or even trippleing the limit would create more inscentive to make more avatars quest compatable without having to worry about such an artifical limit. Especially with the introduction of phys-bones you basically have to choose between having physbones and being able to customize your avatar.",
